# Agentic workflow

- Read `docs/ASSIGNMENT.md` before changing product behavior.
- Stay inside the ownership table in `AGENTS.md`. Schema goes to `database-engineer`, API to `backend-engineer`, UI to `frontend-engineer`, workflows and the OpenAPI file to `ci-engineer`.
- A phase is done only after `scripts/verify.sh` passes for the checks that exist and `docs/PROGRESS.md` cites evidence.
- Project skills override vendored design skills on accessibility and reduced motion.
